          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "OpenAI adds 'Trusted Contact' safeguard to ChatGPT for users showing signs of self-harm",
            "articleSection": "Policy & Rights",
            "abstract": "OpenAI has introduced a new safety feature called 'Trusted Contact' for ChatGPT that activates when a conversation shows signs of a user potentially engaging in self-harm. The feature allows users to pre-designate a trusted person who can be notified in high-risk situations, extending OpenAI's existing crisis-intervention protocols. The rollout represents a significant expansion of platform-level duty-of-care obligations for consumer AI products.",
            "url": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/05/07/openai-introduces-new-trusted-contact-safeguard-for-cases-of-possible-self-harm/",
            "publisher": {
              "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization",
